WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
KidLens Android 0.1.0: local profiles and explicit parent-managed device rules.

00:08.000 --> 00:28.000
Open Family and authenticate. Android protects the credential screen from recording.

00:28.000 --> 00:48.000
Read the full in-app disclosure about visible addresses, local rules, and limitations.

00:48.000 --> 01:02.000
Without consent, the Android permission entry stays disabled.

01:02.000 --> 01:12.200
Leave the parent area. Reopening Family requires device authentication again.

01:12.200 --> 01:39.200
Reopen Family to choose whether to consent to device rules.

01:39.200 --> 01:57.200
Enter the explicit Clock app rule: com.android.deskclock.

01:57.200 --> 02:10.700
Affirmative consent, save rules, and open Android permission settings.

02:10.700 --> 02:41.700
Review the Android warning and explicitly grant KidLens accessibility permission.

02:41.700 --> 02:47.700
Android confirms the KidLens service is enabled.

02:47.700 --> 02:59.000
Launching the explicitly blocked Clock app returns to Home. Verified on signed build 2.
